From: Lionel Debieve <lionel.debieve@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Jun 2021 14:14:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1023/1695] libpng: import library version to 1.6.37

Import libpng 1.6.37 that is the lastest available tag known
with CVE fixes.
Libpng aims to serve in Trusted User Interface (TUI) support.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f7e4fe30ede05ef164aa56287b0a3c6ccea0bb69 libpng: import library version to 1.6.37]
